# s79b lb2: lb1 with U RESTING EXTENDED (head at (1,-1)) and driven ideally through the redstone block (1,-3) under it: open = retract at a (pull BM), pulse at b (pull C); close = pulse at c (push C up, spit), extend at d and stay. K and L0 REAL (watcher, dropper chain): the watcher count is 3 per edge.
